{
  "name": "Alchemical Savant",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You develop masterful command of magical chemicals, enhancing the healing and damage you create through them. Whenever you cast a spell while you have alchemist's supplies on your person, you gain a bonus to one roll of the spell. That roll must restore hit points or be a damage roll that deals acid, fire, necrotic, or poison damage, and the bonus equals your Intelligence modifier (minimum of +1).</p>",
